  "common_prompt": "Use case: identity-preserve.\nAsset: a production Unity 2D game CHARACTER-ONLY animation sprite sheet.\nREFERENCE: Stand.png is the exact GreenSummon character identity reference. Match its drawing, not a generic caster. Preserve exact costume and proportions: pale blue-gray skin, red glowing eyes, jade gem headband, green lower-face mask, emerald and gold cloud-scroll armor/robe, light jade-green long sashes, layered robe panels, ornate gold-trimmed boots, jade belt gem. Three-quarter LEFT-facing throughout, fixed camera and drawing scale. Anatomical LEFT hand is at screen RIGHT gripping the tall banner pole; anatomical RIGHT hand is at screen LEFT, open for casting.\nONE COMPLETE INTACT BANNER: preserve reference pole height, dark-green shaft, gold collars, large diamond jade finials at BOTH ends, gold crossbar at top, two jade-bead green tassels, long emerald swallowtail cloth with gold border and identical gold/light-jade cloud pattern. Cloth remains attached to its crossbar, crossbar remains attached to shaft. Do not make a short staff, change into a weapon, lose tassels, split or duplicate the banner. One envoy and one complete banner per frame.\nSTYLE: identical clean strong dark line weight and polished cel shading to Stand.png. Retain the same jade/gold/pale-green palette and ornament, no redesign.\nMANDATORY CANVAS: 1024 wide x 1536 tall RGBA PNG with real transparent alpha. EXACTLY SIXTEEN full-body figures in FOUR columns and FOUR rows. Invisible cells are 256 wide x 384 tall. Read poses left-to-right, top-to-bottom; continue time across row transitions.\nMANDATORY SMALL SCALE: character AND complete banner including finials and tassels together at most 178px wide and 288px tall inside each cell. Neutral complete silhouette about 160px wide x 230px tall, body alone about 165px tall. Keep lots of EMPTY SPACE on all four sides. At least 39px EMPTY left/right margin and 40px EMPTY top/bottom margin in every cell, including external canvas edges. Align standing boot soles to a fixed cell-local ground line y=328, body center near x=116. Choose small scale from F1 so wide pole sweeps and overhead banner fit without changing body/prop scale. Never fill the sheet or enlarge figures. No character, robe, sash, hand, boot, flag corner, tassel or pole tip crosses a cell edge or is clipped. All 16 complete cutouts are separated by wide transparent gutters.\nTRANSPARENCY: outside figures must be empty alpha zero. No background color, scenery, gradient, floor, cast shadow, texture or drawn checkerboard. No visible grid, borders, labels, numbers, text or watermark. No enemies, projectiles, summoned creatures, spectral hammer, drawn sigil, aura, spark, impact, dust, blood, motion line or effect. Render only character and physical banner.\n",
